    "implementation_delta": "Publish DatasetsSemanticApiCatalog@1 as the closed, versioned public catalog for canonical IR identity, source lineage, ContextPack construction, proof obligations, proof-result validation, translation receipts, interpolation, CEGAR, incremental SMT, and source and rights manifests. DatasetsContextPack@1 is the canonical ContextPack identity contract using ir-canonical-identity-v1. DatasetsContextPackAuthority@0.1 and SemanticPublicAPI@1 remain compatibility-only. Free-form, advisory-as-authority, and executable-without-bounds requests fail closed. Identities are deterministic. Live solvers remain typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
